# Direct dependencies of tool/play_promote.py, pinned. play-promote.yml
# installs the hash-locked play_promote_requirements.txt compiled from this
# file, so the job holding the Play service account never resolves anything
# at run time. Recompile after changing a pin:
#
#   uv pip compile --python-version 3.13 --generate-hashes \
#     tool/play_promote_requirements.in -o tool/play_promote_requirements.txt
